          "qualitative_or_quantitative_description": "SAED patterns show the fine interface particles have an FCC crystalline structure with FCC twins frequently observed within the particles; the Cu-rich particles are rich in Cu, depleted in Fe and Mn and slightly poor in Al, while the β-Mn is poor in Cu."
        }
